["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bernhard von Gudden: Ludwig II’s Psychiatrist somatic psychiatry non-restraint policy retrospective diagnosis Pick&#x27;s disease\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-stuffmissed-写报告前-医生没见过那位被判精神失常的国王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>寫報告前，醫生沒見過那位被判精神失常的國王</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">路德維希二世被廢黜的依據，是一份古登從未問診國王本人、只憑政敵證詞寫成的精神病報告；兩人隨後雙雙溺斃，死因至今成謎。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神醫學史</span><span class=\"tag\">王室秘聞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Richard Hanania on Conrad&#x27;s Nostromo, Latin American Crime, and Populism material interests negro liberalism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-tyler-一本写于1904年的小说-精准预演了拉美民粹政治的死循环/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42df6b9f173f5224-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>一本寫於1904年的小說，精準預演了拉美民粹政治的死循環</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小說裡外國資本把礦業變成國家支柱，也帶來發展，但煽動家和腐敗將領輪番上位的循環從未被打破——這是拉美政治至今未解的死結。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span><span class=\"tag\">發展經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New AI Agents That Shop, Plan, and Gossip OpenClaw Moltbook MCP picnic\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-a16z-ai助理最大的信任障碍不是隐私泄露-而是让你当众出丑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>AI助理最大的信任障礙不是隱私洩露，而是讓你當眾出醜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用戶嘴上說擔心隱私，真正在意的是不被agent說漏嘴而丟臉——這才是阻礙信任、拖慢滲透的真正瓶頸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">消費產品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Casado on Frontier Model Economics, AI&#x27;s Slowdown, and the Cursor Deal - [Invest Like the Best, EP.498] mythical man month NeoCloud NeoLab OLTP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-ilt-最强模型拿下八成市场-但护城河只够撑三到六个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5467ed92a069a36b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>最強模型拿下八成市場，但護城河只夠撐三到六個月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">只要市場還在擴張，最前沿的模型就能拿走八成支出；但模型的保質期只有三到六個月，一旦掉隊幾乎沒有長尾可言，護城河隨時清零。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">前沿模型經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Big Beef: The War on Your Wallet | A Bloody Business | 1 boxed beef vertical integration Packers Consent Decree feedlot class action\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-businesswars-撤销一纸同意令-牛肉加工业集中度十年内翻倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d30f1b7fb3078628-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">41:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Business Wars</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>撤銷一紙同意令，牛肉加工業集中度十年內翻倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1981年裡根政府放行後，四大肉企十年內從控制三成牛肉加工暴漲到控制八成，用併購而非技術壟斷了市場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">反壟斷</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈議價權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"徠芬科技創始人葉洪新×羅永浩！初中畢業後，我先造飛機去了...... FA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-04-cn2d7912-读书只读到初中毕业-他把吹风机做到了全球销量第一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9155e2c533270be3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:19:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>讀書只讀到初中畢業，他把吹風機做到了全球銷量第一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他造載人飛行器、賣電動滑板車兩次燒光借來的錢，卻靠自學攢下的無刷電機技術，後來把吹風機做到戴森五分之一的價格，賣成全球銷量第一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件創業</span><span class=\"tag\">國產替代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⚡️ The 2026 Software Factory Standard — Zach Lloyd, Warp.dev software factory harness scorers / online evals factory engineering ADLC/SDLC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-latentspace-pr成本从80美元砍到20美元-不是换模型-是把工厂写成代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">34:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>PR成本從80美元砍到20美元，不是換模型，是把工廠寫成代碼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Warp把內部軟件工廠整個定義成代碼並接入觀測閉環後，靠「觀察-測量-調優」把每個PR成本從80美元壓到15到20美元，PR吞吐同時提升40%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">軟件工廠</span><span class=\"tag\">agent編排</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"3 new scandals show being a pain in the ass for AI labs is a legit job now | Rob Wiblin looped transformers chain of thought non-disparagement agreement federal preemption Not For Private Gain campaign\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-eightythousand-anthropic的法案让人几乎没法叫停危险的ai训练/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d70069c16841d26d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">29:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic的法案讓人幾乎沒法叫停危險的AI訓練</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法案把叫停權壓縮成商務部長簽字、一家特區法院45天內拍板，模型真出事時幾乎來不及按下剎車。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"E208 A股又是大震盪，價值投資的實踐、挑戰和思考 | 永慶、David 對談弘尚資產張駿\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-touzishizhan-亏钱不是a股的错-是你对它的认知不够/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/478f2b894977699e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投資實戰派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>虧錢不是A股的錯，是你對它的認知不夠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張駿復盤今年60多的累計回撤後發現，A股牛短熊長、資金久期短的根源，從來不是市場本身，而是投資者對公司內在價值和宏觀週期的認知跟不上變化的速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">價值投資</span><span class=\"tag\">內在價值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"老黃經濟學：一口氣看懂英偉達的商業帝國 Jevons Paradox DSXPORT Productive / Fungible / Durable circular financing ACIE\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-laoshi-下一财年-英伟达四分之一营收要靠自己给客户撑腰/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1f942ceb55eb0d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>下一財年，英偉達四分之一營收要靠自己給客戶撐腰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達一邊把GPU包裝成可融資資產，一邊自掏腰包投資AI實驗室、幫客戶墊錢買自己的芯片，循環融資撐起營收，也讓應收賬款飆到631億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">循環融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Roasting China&#x27;s AI Industry (中文版) benchmark RSI scaling law PMF\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-chinatalk-大模型是制造业不是魔法-谁都别想领先超过一个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae93881f9f6bfed0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>大模型是製造業不是魔法：誰都別想領先超過一個月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喪鐘AI的作者認為，大模型廠沒有任何能保密的技術差異，數據和算力就是生產資料，這和光伏、手機、電動車的邏輯一樣——誰的領先都撐不過一個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國產大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">視頻生成模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The company building America’s uranium supply from scratch HALEU SMR LCOE EPC cost-plus\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-cheekypint-美国核燃料断供倒计时-2028年前必须自己造出浓缩铀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5900de8bd0ec158-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">59:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>美國核燃料斷供倒計時：2028年前必須自己造出濃縮鈾</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">冷戰後美國放棄了自己的鈾濃縮產能，轉而靠進口俄羅斯核燃料；國會定下2028年禁令，General Matter要搶在那之前建成本土產能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">核能</span><span class=\"tag\">鈾濃縮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Andrew Huberman’s Three Rules for Better Health and Focus NSDR / Yoga Nidra N-acetylcysteine (NAC) sex hormone binding globulin P5P\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-a16z-创始人每天只有两段黄金专注期-被打断代价是指数级的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>創始人每天只有兩段黃金專注期，被打斷代價是指數級的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Huberman說普通人一天真正高效的專注窗口通常只有兩三段，這段時間被無關的事打斷，損失的不是那幾個小時，而是指數級拖累整體產出。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">健康習慣</span><span class=\"tag\">力量訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"K.C. Irving: Competing with Giants vertical integration Combines Investigation Act succession duties equal opportunity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-knowledge-政府想用遗产税拆散家族企业-他干脆移居百慕大保住控制权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d457e7b70836700-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>政府想用遺產稅拆散家族企業，他乾脆移居百慕大保住控制權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">凱西·歐文六十年只信一條規則——重要的東西必須自己掌控。當新稅制第一次威脅到這份100%所有權時，他選擇帶著全部財產離開新不倫瑞克。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家族企業</span><span class=\"tag\">縱向整合</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Remembering Noah Adams Transgenic Pets pivot point sprinkler\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-throughline-战争博物馆里挂满英雄照-却没有一张受害者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>戰爭博物館裡掛滿英雄照，卻沒有一張受害者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">諾亞·亞當斯90年代在貝爾格萊德軍事博物館的觀察：兩小時展品從九世紀弓箭到二戰坦克，全是英雄影像，沒有一張受害者照片——戰爭因此被講述成了常態。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NPR</span><span class=\"tag\">口述歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"513 為永明時代作傳：林曉光談南齊武帝蕭賾與南朝文學的爆發 檢籍 土斷 黃籍/白籍 永明聲律\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-cn2aa250-近体诗平仄格律-本质是贵族社会的等级礼仪搬进了诗歌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>近體詩平仄格律，本質是貴族社會的等級禮儀搬進了詩歌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">南齊永明年間發現漢語四聲只是起點，真正讓近體詩定型的是貴族社會要求人人恰如其分嵌入等級秩序這套邏輯——內容平庸也算詩，平仄不合就不算詩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">南北朝</span><span class=\"tag\">貴族社會</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An Election Day Special With Nate Silver dummymander elasticity digital twin generic ballot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-oddlots-民调不是在低估共和党-而是在怕错而过度修正/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">42:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>民調不是在低估共和黨，而是在怕錯而過度修正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">緬因州一份民調把民主黨原始9個點的領先，硬是用「可能投票模型」壓成2個點——Nate Silver說這不是技術失誤，是民調機構怕重蹈2016年低估特朗普覆轍後的自我保護。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民調方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Q&amp;A: How to know if my child may have depression? internalizing issue externalizing warm handoff genetic loading\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-secureattach-四岁孩子反复说自己难过长达数月-值得认真对待/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">24:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>四歲孩子反覆說自己難過長達數月，值得認真對待</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個四歲男孩連續數月說自己難過卻說不清原因，心理學家認為這已夠格去做專業評估——幼兒抑鬱罕見但確實存在，而且可以治療。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">幼兒抑鬱</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 226 Glanders: Straight from the horse’s mouth Burkholderia mallei Burkholderia pseudomallei Farcy Tier 1 select agent Koch&#x27;s postulates\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-tpwky-鼻疽至今没有疫苗-防控唯一办法就是扑杀所有感染动物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>鼻疽至今沒有疫苗，防控唯一辦法就是撲殺所有感染動物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這種專性寄生在馬屬動物體內的細菌致死率超過90%，對抗生素天生耐藥，人類研究了一百多年，唯一拿得出手的辦法還是「發現就殺」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">傳染病</span><span class=\"tag\">獸醫史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"296: Avoidance Feeds Anxiety: When to Make Teens Do Hard Things | Dr. Meredith Elkins exposure-based therapy accommodation SPACE program\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-asklisa-父母越是心疼着接送孩子逃避-焦虑就越难治好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bc857b2c3fda762e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">43:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>父母越是心疼著接送孩子逃避，焦慮就越難治好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迴避帶來的輕鬆會讓大腦記住「這件事我搞不定」,下次更想逃；真正管用的辦法是分級直面讓自己不舒服的事，這套框架對輕度緊張和臨床焦慮症同樣有效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">焦慮障礙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"When Toddlers Resist Absolutely Everything the untethered twos\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-unruffled-两岁娃的疯狂抵抗不是亲子关系出问题-而是情绪在自愈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">30:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>兩歲娃的瘋狂抵抗不是親子關係出問題，而是情緒在自愈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩歲孩子對上車、洗澡、牽手過馬路樣樣說不，是因為經歷鉅變卻毫無掌控感，這時該做的不是給更多選擇，而是把邊界收得更早更緊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">兩歲兒童</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"“You’re Too Sensitive” Isn’t Helpful — Here’s What Is, with Dr. Sasha Hamdani RSD (Rejection Sensitive Dysphoria) amygdala prefrontal cortex DFK (deeply feeling kids) emotional vaccination\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-03-goodinside-怕被拒绝不是矫情-杏仁核过度警觉-前额叶跟不上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">49:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>怕被拒絕不是矯情：杏仁核過度警覺，前額葉跟不上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理醫生 Sasha Hamdani 說：被拒絕的恐懼不是性格問題，而是杏仁核過度警覺、前額葉反應不足導致的真實神經反應，道理勸不醒它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">拒絕敏感性煩躁症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Legal Agents When You Can&#x27;t See the Data - Jacob Lauritzen, CTO of Legora Tabular Review Forward Deployed Engineer Legal Engineer Pareto frontier DPA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-latentspace-法律ai最大的工程难题不是模型-是永远看不到真实数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/927785d01eabb481-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>法律AI最大的工程難題不是模型，是永遠看不到真實數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">客戶數據大多連律所自己都無權查看，Legora的evals團隊只能靠分類和改寫後的合成數據，去猜測律師們真實在做什麼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法律科技</span><span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Robots Already Working in American Factories | Tutor Intelligence teleoperator / tutor greenfield market HRI(Human-Robot Interaction) action diffusion transformer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-02-a16z-机器人创业公司不卖ai-只卖-时薪16美元-这句话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>機器人創業公司不賣AI,只賣「時薪16美元」這句話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tutor向從未買過機器人的工廠主推銷時，從不提模型和AI,只說一個數字——時薪16美元的機器人；這背後是美國一年僅部署3.8萬臺工業機器人、九成工廠空白的現實。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>"]